| API1 BOLA | Modify object ID in URL/body | Repeater → edit ID | Manual only | Fail if another user's data is returned |
| API2 Broken Auth | Use expired token | JWT Editor → modify token | Manual only | Fail if API accepts expired token |
| API3 Property Auth | Add hidden JSON fields | Repeater → add `"isAdmin": true` | Manual only | Fail if API applies change |
| API4 Resource | Flood endpoint | Intruder → Cluster Bomb | Manual only | Fail if no HTTP 429 |
| API5 Function Auth | Access admin endpoint with user token | Repeater → change URL | Manual only | Fail if endpoint is accessible |
| API6 Mass Assignment | Send extra JSON parameters | Repeater | Manual only | Fail if parameters applied |
| API7 Misconfig | Check headers/TLS | Target → Issues | Enable TLS/header checks | Fail if weak TLS or missing headers |
| API8 Injection | Insert `' OR 1=1--` | Intruder | Enable injection plugins | Fail if injection successful |
| API9 Inventory | Fuzz endpoints | Intruder → API wordlists | Manual only | Fail if undocumented endpoints found |
| API10 Unsafe Consumption | Alter 3rd-party API responses | Repeater | Manual only | Fail if API trusts modified data |

